"A TeleNVDA {channel} update is available: version {version}.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to download and install it now?"
msgstr "En TeleNVDA {channel} opdatering er tilgængelig: version {version}.\n\nVil du downloade og installere den nu?"

#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:299
msgid "development"
